The plate looks like a compostable paper plate, roughly 20 cm across (about 245 px in the image). It holds sliced sausage, perhaps smoked sausage or andouille, in about 12 pieces. Each piece is a half-moon about 4 cm across and 2 cm thick, so roughly 15-20 g each. That puts the total near 200 g, perhaps 180 g.

Smoked sausage runs about 300 kcal per 100 g, so 180 g comes to about 540 kcal. The pieces are stacked loosely, so I'll settle on about 170 g and 500 kcal.

